# GRU512/768 Muon capacity V4 profile-only packet

V4 preserves V3's model, seed, clean-fold split, objective, sampler and measured profile shapes. It corrects the consumer to use the producer's `original_identity.bytes` field and checks the expected portable SHA/size against the prior observed SHA/size before taking the stat-reuse path. Profile-only; no fit is authorized. V3's terminal failure remains preserved as execution evidence.

The private source dataset contains only packet files. Raw train/valid and the named fold0 assets remain separate read-only mounts. This V4 candidate has not been uploaded or pushed.
